<6-x-2>{\selectlanguage {english}\color {blue}\bfseries \LRnum {3.9}~}{\bfseries \selectlanguage {iast}}\ekdsep {\selectlanguage {english}In \getsiglum {G4}, this verse is followed by \emph {Vivekamārtaṇḍa} 58 and \HP \ 3.17(c)d–18ab. 3.17cd is written at the correct place again, but 3.18 is omitted there. The confusion may be due to an eye-skip caused by \textit {gopanīyaṃ/°yā prayatnena} in 3.9a and 3.18c.\lb After 4.9, \getsiglum {J10,C6,V3} have the following verse: \vspaceinnote \\ \devnote {vajrolīr amaroliś ca sahajolis tridhā mataḥ/ eteṣāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ vakṣye kartavyaṃ ca viśeṣataḥ//} (cf. \emph {Dattātreyayogaśāstra} 31c–32b)\\ \scriptsize vajrolīr \getsiglum {J10,V3}\,] °lī tv \getsiglum {C6} ; amaroliś \getsiglum {J10}\,] °lī \getsiglum {C6}, °līś \getsiglum {V3} ; sahajolis \getsiglum {J10}\,] °lī \getsiglum {C6,V3} ; matāḥ \getsiglum {C6}\,] mataḥ \getsiglum {J10}, magaḥ \getsiglum {V3} ; eteṣāṃ \getsiglum {J10,V3}\,] etāṣāṃ \getsiglum {C6} }</6-x-2>
