<13-x-2>{\selectlanguage {english}\color {blue}\bfseries \LRnum {3.19}~}{\bfseries \selectlanguage {iast}}\ekdsep {\selectlanguage {english}\manuref {3.19c–3.20d} are omitted in \getsiglum {P11} and \getsiglum {N19,V15}, probably due to an eye-skip caused by \textit {niyojayet} in 3.19b and 3.20d. In the latter manuscripts, however, the lines are inserted after \ref {matam}ab. It seems that they were supplied from a manuscript of the \textalpha \ or \textdelta \ group, as they are followed by \ref {III21} in \getsiglum {N19}.}</13-x-2>
