<40-x-2>{\selectlanguage {english}\color {blue}\bfseries \LRnum {3.48*1}~}{\bfseries \selectlanguage {iast}}\ekdsep {\selectlanguage {english}\getsiglum {P11,C6} have this verse immediately after \ref {III39}; \getsiglum {N3,V19,C7} have it in chapter four (\manuref {4.9}), and \getsiglum {J5,G4,Gamma} in both chapter three and four. \getsiglum {E2} omits it in both places. \mydelim Before this verse, \getsiglum {J10,V3,Jyo} have the same verse as \manuref {X4.45}. \getsiglum {J10} and \getsiglum {V3} have it also in chapter four, while \getsiglum {Jyo} has it only here.}</40-x-2>
