<41-x-2>{\selectlanguage {english}\color {blue}\bfseries \LRnum {prescript:}~}{\bfseries \selectlanguage {iast}}\ekdsep {\selectlanguage {english}In \getsiglum {G4}, the description of Uḍḍīyāṇabandha (3.58–65) follows after this heading for Mūlabandha. Similarly, in \getsiglum {V3} and \getsiglum {Jyo} (and also some \texteta \textsubscript {\textomega } manuscripts) Uḍḍīyāṇabandha is described before Mūlabandha, but with the correct heading each.}</41-x-2>
